-- title:
--   Original BV actual strict HJB prebudget with integrable random finite-grid errors tending to zero in expectation
-- statement:
--   Actual original-X/D strict Iio T dividend cash and surviving reserve terminal satisfy the sharp real expectation inequality if their finite physical grid payoff is bounded by a signed nonpositive-mean stochastic source plus an integrable random mesh error whose expected value tends to zero.
-- source:
--   Centre each physical integrable random mesh error by subtracting its expectation. The adjusted source residual remains integrable with nonpositive mean; the deterministic remainder equals the error expectation, tending to zero. Apply fully Proved original physical Fatou bridge 3bada784. No canonical Open premises.

